// A unicode space beside a quote stays off the suggestion.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE pad ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG pad law

IMPULSE pad 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "pad" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
